                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "10babb6f-8c54-48e2-b911-33c68e286faf",
                                                "sense_id": "9849d1c7-cc71-3544-9351-85b5c1b81842",
                                                "text": "SALLY, who began to be tir'd with her Canonis'd Suitor, drew up the Curtain, alias her Hoop-Petticoat, &c. and clapping her Hand upon Madge, said, Ecce Signum, Doctor. This is my only Support, and I hope will continue so to my Life's End."
